post-it: Computer doesn't start
cause: Parts in the wrong places
symptoms:
	No picture at all
	Stops before Windows starts
checks:
	Shows a picture at power-on
		shows: the fans run and nothing shows: the CPU is not in its socket
	Every part sits in its own place
		shows: in the Workview, parts lie on the places of other parts
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Put each part back in its own place
	Get any missing part from storage and install it
	Remount the shell
notes:
	Broken part: All hardware are in the wrong places
